{%- when 'war' -%}{%- if isb -%}Each robot in this bundle keeps its WYBOT warranty: {{ warr }} year{% if warr != '1' %}s{% endif %} for the {{ name }} and 1 year for the F1. Warranty claims go through WYBOT support, and Yard Automation Pros helps you file and follow up.{%- else -%}WYBOT covers the {{ name }} with a {{ warr }}-year manufacturer warranty. Warranty claims go through WYBOT support, and Yard Automation Pros helps you file and follow up.{%- endif -%}
{%- when 'ship' -%}Free shipping within the contiguous US. WYBOT processes orders within 2 business days and quotes 3 to 7 business days for delivery, by FedEx or Amazon Logistics. WYBOT does not ship to Alaska, Hawaii, Rhode Island, US territories or PO boxes.
{%- endcase -%}
